    <string name="transparency_card_title">100% Local &amp; Transparent</string>
    <string name="transparency_card_body">SN Creativity does not connect to any cloud AI model, LLM, or external API. Instead, it uses a deterministic local library of creator hooks, script frameworks, hashtag taxonomy, and visual composition templates.\n\nLimitations: Because no live AI service is connected, outputs do not search live internet trends or invent facts beyond the topic you enter. Always tailor specific game mechanics or stats to your footage.</string>
